# Static GitHub Pages builds show a safe disconnected state by default.
# For non-Pages production host behind SAME ORIGIN and leave unset (/api/v1).
# For specifically approved staging only, an HTTPS public API origin can be supplied
# with CORS explicitly restricted on Laravel; never include admin credentials here.
# VITE_CARFOLK_API_BASE=https://your-staging-domain.example/api/v1
